=== GALACTIC PILOT GUIDE: BANKING & INSURANCE ===

Protect your hard-earned assets against catastrophic loss in deep space.
* BANK VAULT: Deposit credits at Stardock Alpha to earn compound interest.

INSURANCE POLICIES:
  * Uninsured:         Retains 100% of credits safely deposited in Bank Vault.
                       Rescue tug recovers you in an Escape Pod (0 cr, no ship).
  * Bronze (500 cr):   Retains 100% Bank Vault. Grants Scout Sloop + 100 cr.
  * Silver (3,000 cr): Retains Bank Vault + 50% pocket credits + Ship Model.
  * Gold (10,000 cr):  Retains Bank Vault + 100% pocket credits + Ship Model +
                       all cargo & equipment upgrades fully restored!
  Note: Policies are single-use and must be re-purchased after each rescue.
